    },
    {
      "type": "subheading",
      "title": "3. Brooks–Corey θ(ψ)模型替代数据法（Saxton等，1986）"
    },
    {
      "type": "model-note",
      "text": "替代数据法基于土壤质地经验回归，用式(84.4a)～式(84.4c)计算θ_sat、b和a。Cl为直径<2 μm的黏粒质量百分数，Sa为0.05～2 mm砂粒的质量百分数；此砂粒范围按USDA系统划分，不同于英国和澳大利亚系统，后续算例见表84.4的质地调整。式(84.4c)所得a的单位为kPa。"
    }
  ],
  "formulas": [
    {
      "label": "84.3b",
      "plain": "b=−Δx/Δy=−[lg|ψ₁|−lg|ψ₂|]/(lgθ₁−lgθ₂)",
      "latex": "b=-\\frac{\\Delta x}{\\Delta y}=-\\frac{\\lg|\\psi_1|-\\lg|\\psi_2|}{\\lg\\theta_1-\\lg\\theta_2}"
    },
    {
      "label": "84.3c",
      "plain": "lg|ψ_i|=−b(lgθ_i−lgθ₁)+lg|ψ₁|",
      "latex": "\\lg|\\psi_i|=-b(\\lg\\theta_i-\\lg\\theta_1)+\\lg|\\psi_1|"
    },
    {
      "label": "84.4a",
      "plain": "θ_sat=A+B(Sa)+D ln(Cl)",
      "latex": "\\theta_{sat}=A+B(Sa)+D\\ln(Cl)"
    },
    {
      "label": "84.4b",
      "plain": "b=E+F(Cl)²+G(Sa)²(Cl)",
      "latex": "b=E+F(Cl)^2+G(Sa)^2(Cl)"
    },
    {
      "label": "84.4c",
      "plain": "a=100exp[H+I(Cl)+J(Sa)²+L(Sa)²(Cl)]/θ_sat^b（kPa）",
      "latex": "a=\\frac{100\\exp\\!\\left[H+I(Cl)+J(Sa)^2+L(Sa)^2(Cl)\\right]}{\\theta_{sat}^{b}}\\ \\mathrm{kPa}"
    }
  ],
